# Clickable Screenshots — environment variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and replace every `CHANGE_ME` value with the
values for your environment. Nothing here is committed to the repository.

## Client-safe (prefixed with `EXPO_PUBLIC_`, safe to ship in the app bundle)

| Variable | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_NAME` | `Clickable Screenshots` | App name |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_VERSION` | `0.1.0` | Bump on releases |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_BUILD` | `1` | Bump on releases |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_MOCK_MODE` | `true` | v1 runs local/mock adapters for OCR, AI and the store |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_OCR_PROVIDER` | `mock` | `mock` | `cloud` (when backend is live) |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_PROVIDER` | `mock` | Only used when AI features are enabled |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUBSCRIPTIONS_PROVIDER` | `mock` | Set to `revenuecat` once configured |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` | `http://localhost:4000` | Local development API base URL |
| `EXPO_PUBLIC_PRODUCTION_URL` | `https://clickablescreenshots.app` | Production Deep-link / share URL |

## Server-safe (keep out of the app bundle)

| Variable | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `REVENUECAT_PUBLIC_KEY` | `CHANGE_ME` | RevenueCat public key (from the dashboard) |
| `SUPABASE_URL` | `CHANGE_ME` | Future backend — Supabase URL |
| `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | `CHANGE_ME` | Future backend — anon key |
| `FIREBASE_API_KEY` | `CHANGE_ME` | Future backend — Firebase API key |

## Native app metadata

| Variable | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `IOS_BUNDLE_ID` | `com.clickablescreenshots.app` | Build identifier for iOS |
| `ANDROID_PACKAGE` | `com.clickablescreenshots` | Build identifier for Android |
